# Coding

- **TPP DRY**: one authoritative place per piece of knowledge (game rules in engine, theme in `packages/ui`). Knowledge/intent — not line-dedupe.
- No over-abstraction, no one-export files, no layers “for later.”
- **Bun** workspaces; **Vitest** for engine/dictionary.
- Engine owns adjacency, scoring, targets, gen thresholds, accept/reject. UI displays and wires input.
- Coincidental similar code with different meaning stays separate.
